--- !u!114 &934463773
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 934463768}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd36620a718271b4b92318e9061ca1d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  npcDialoguePanel: {fileID: 414319386}
  npcDialogueText: {fileID: 1541729034}
  playerDialoguePanel: {fileID: 313694386}
  playerDialogueText: {fileID: 136176473}
  dialogue:
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: Hey, Alice, can I ask you something? What is this place, and why were you
      locked inside that storage room?
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Hmm... This is the basement where my family keeps old antiques.
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "I was playing hide and seek here with my maid, but she couldn\u2019t find
      me. So, I waited for her to come, but instead, you found me. (pauses, looking
      thoughtful)"
  - speaker: Alice
    line: I believed someone would find me eventually.
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: What?! How long have you been waiting in there?
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "I don\u2019t know, honestly. I lost track of time... I just kept waiting."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "That\u2019s crazy. Didn\u2019t your family try to look for you?"
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "I... I don\u2019t know. Usually, when I go missing, someone comes to get
      me. But that day, no one came."
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "(Could this be connected to that article I read? But that happened decades
      ago\u2026 she should be long gone by now.) (I\u2019m missing too many pieces
      of this puzzle. I need to explore more.)"
  - speaker: Hazil
    line: "Don\u2019t worry, Alice. I\u2019ll get us out of here."
  - speaker: Alice
    line: Thank you, Hazil. I knew I could depend on you.
  - speaker: Alice
    line: "But be careful on the next floor\u2014there are some tricks up ahead."
  npcContButton: {fileID: 304518190}
  playerContButton: {fileID: 1189673989}
